00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:27.420
What?

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.990
A witch?

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:36.430
Come on. Don't mess with me.

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:39.260
Oh, I get it. You're lost, right?

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:41.900
Where's your home? I'll take you there.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:43.060
Do you know where you are?

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.440
Open, gate of magical power: Damel.

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:47.580
There are planes flying 
around in this day and age.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:51.250
There's no way you're... a witch...

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:57.620
Th-That car is flying...

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:00.590
I am not messing with you.

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:05.750
I granted you your wish,

00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:08.730
so in exchange, I'm claiming your life.

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:09.210
What?

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:11.380
It's in our contract.

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:12.970
Contract?

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:15.470
I granted your wish.

00:01:16.710 --> 00:01:17.980
My wish?

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:23.160
<i>She couldn't mean...</i>

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:25.510
<i>From that time?</i>

00:02:58.050 --> 00:03:01.780
I Will Grant You Your Wish

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:01.780
Why?

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:04.490
Why do I have to die for a pair of panties?!

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:06.580
Is my life worth less than panties?!

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:09.000
That was your decision.

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:13.490
<i>A few days ago...</i>

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:17.170
<b>West High School</b>

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:21.170
<i>It all began with a book 
I came across in the library.</i>

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:18.920
<b>Witch Summoning Manual</b>

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:24.610
If that book is real, 
this is a major discovery.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:27.250
If we can actually summon a witch,

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:30.300
our Mysterious Discovery Club
 will become famous!

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:32.720
We'll be officially recognized as a club!

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:35.200
You don't dream very big, Senpai.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:38.650
You can do it, Shibaraku!

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:40.910
My name's not Shibaraku, it's Shibaki!

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:42.270
Sheesh...

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:47.620
God of power in the spirit world, 
open the gate and grant me power.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:47.950
<i>I already know what I'll wish for.</i>

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:50.380
Open, gate of magical power! Give me...

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:51.460
<i>A cute girlfriend!</i>

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:56.420
<i>In elementary school, 
girls kept their distance</i>

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.900
<i>because I was famous for flipping skirts!</i>

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:00.570
<i>In middle school, girls nicknamed me</i>

00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:03.580
<i>the King of Porn becaused I lent 
porn magazines to everyone!</i>

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:05.570
<i>And now, after I screamed "Boobs!"</i>

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:08.510
<i>Boobs!</i>

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:08.510
<i>in my sleep during class, 
girls give me the cold shoulder!</i>

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:11.430
