00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:17.360
However, as a man, I want to 
reach an even higher stage!

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:19.240
You've been talking a while.

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:21.740
Did you ask for a cute girlfriend?

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:24.060
Huh? What?

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:27.120
<b>Witch Summoning Manual</b>

