00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:29.990
That's gotta be it!

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:33.310
Way to go, Shiba-kun.

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:36.710
I definitely would've asked 
for a cute girlfriend.

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:41.460
You have no ambition, Shibaraku.

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:47.650
<i>In the end, nothing happened.</i>

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.270
<i>But when I got home...</i>

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:56.890
