it's a type of funeral.

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:21.800
You will be eaten. It may hurt a little.

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:23.120
Hurt?!

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:25.480
You mean I'll be alive? I'll be eaten alive?

00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:28.590
I don't want that!

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:31.710
