00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:31.480
<i>You're kidding, right?</i>

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:34.370
<i>She wore these?</i>

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:37.370
<i>Now that I get a better look, 
she's actually pretty cute.</i>

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:38.710
<i>No, no! Hold on!</i>

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:41.880
<i>There's something more important here.</i>

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:47.090
