00:06:51.230 --> 00:06:53.030
<i>All right!</i>

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:54.900
<i>The tables have turned!</i>

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:56.100
<i>I'm a genius!</i>

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.840
<i>I made an awesome wish!</i>

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:01.650
