00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:50.630
Huh?

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:53.050
I was in prison for 60 years.

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:55.510
Y-You were in prison for 60 years?

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:56.750
