00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:57.760
<i>Farewell, female presence in my life.</i>

00:15:58.990 --> 00:16:01.230
<i>If only I could use magic...</i>

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:07.940
<i>I wish I could've seen you 
one more time, Rurumo...</i>

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:12.530
I'm... falling...

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:26.270
She's here...

00:16:26.270 --> 00:16:27.540
It's been a while.

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:30.310
Did someone summon you again?

00:16:30.310 --> 00:16:31.070
No.

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:33.450
Whoa, you took some serious damage.

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:36.760
These clothes are enchanted 
with a regenerative spell.

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:40.980
If I remain still for 48 days, I'll be...

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:45.600
You're not gonna die here, are you?

00:16:45.970 --> 00:16:47.060
Hey, wake up!

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:48.650
Hang in there! Rurumo!

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:51.590
Hey!

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:52.490
Very well.

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:53.950
Remension.

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:58.550
All better.

00:16:58.550 --> 00:17:00.650
Magic sure is useful.

00:17:01.460 --> 00:17:03.410
It's because of your tickets.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:05.670
Over here, Sensei.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:07.920
A loud noise came from over there.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.010
Crap!

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:12.630
Magic tickets?

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:17.360
Yes. I had Chiro, my familiar, 
deliver them to you.

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:20.820
Those will allow you to use my magic freely.

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:22.470
What? Your magic?

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:25.230
But it costs my life, right?

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:27.140
The situation has changed.

00:17:27.140 --> 00:17:31.070
Making a human use those is my training.

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:34.250
Training? You're in training?

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:36.270
I was demoted to a trainee witch.

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:37.030
Why?

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:40.700
The Witch Queen found out 
that I halved your avian burial.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.710
As punishment, she sealed my magic powers,

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:44.540
and my witch qualifications were revoked.

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:46.040
H-Hold on!

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:49.390
It's because you left without 
taking my life, right?

00:17:49.390 --> 00:17:50.540
I'm responsible for this!

00:17:51.010 --> 00:17:54.510
It's not your concern. This is my punishment.

00:17:54.870 --> 00:17:56.560
You don't need to worry about it.

00:17:57.570 --> 00:18:00.390
In that case, I'll use up all these tickets!

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:03.280
Then your training will end!

00:18:04.320 --> 00:18:05.350
For starters...

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:09.980
An invisibility spell to prevent me 
from being seen or discovered!

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:12.870
Hot, hot, hot!

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:14.540
The tickets burn when you use them.

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:15.830
You should've said so first!

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:17.070
Open, gate of magical power.

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:18.320
Rimilus.

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:29.420
Wow! I don't have a reflection!

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:33.380
Now I can return Sawashita-san's bra!

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:40.720
<i>This is awesome! Now I can stare at her 
bra-less chest without anyone noticing!</i>

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:42.890
There she is!

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:44.180
It's Sawashita-san!

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:49.970
It's not here.

00:18:49.970 --> 00:18:51.150
That's weird.

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:52.860
Where did it go?

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:55.820
<i>All right! She's not wearing a bra!</i>

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:58.530
<i>Sawashita-san, Sawashita-san, Sawashita-san...</i>

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:02.180
I could die now! I have no regrets!

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:03.040
Huh?

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:05.480
Why are you pulling on my shirt?

00:19:05.480 --> 00:19:08.030
If I'm not touching you, 
you're not invisible.

00:19:08.510 --> 00:19:10.150
I-I see...

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:14.500
I wonder where it went...

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:16.210
<i>Got it.</i>

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:17.710
<i>I'll return this.</i>

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:20.680
<i>I... I will...</i>

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:23.800
<b>RUMBLE</b>

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:23.800
<b>RUMBLE</b>

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:23.240
<i>return it directly to her!</i>

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:25.840
<i>So long, Tokoda, Fukusuke!</i>

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:29.330
<i>I'm climbing to the higher stage 
of putting a bra on a girl!</i>

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:34.520
You know my older sister left this 
spring to work in England, right?

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:38.530
She bought me that bra 
the day before she left.

00:19:38.930 --> 00:19:41.570
Because we wouldn't see 
each other for a while...

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:46.390
Here it is!

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.570
You're right! Thank goodness!

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:53.910
Was that what you wanted?

00:19:53.910 --> 00:19:57.710
Sheesh... She shouldn't wear 
something so important to school.

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:00.590
I missed my chance to reach a higher stage.

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:03.010
Huh? There's one less.

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:06.970
Those tickets respond to 
your powerful desires.

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:12.210
I was able to heal myself 
because you wished for it.

00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:21.070
Th-Thank...

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:28.910
Sorry.

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:31.440
I'm leaving.

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:31.870
Huh?

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:33.380
Call me again.

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:36.420
Sure! Take care!

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:53.650
What's going on?

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:56.520
Oh, you're Chiro the familiar.

00:20:57.000 --> 00:21:01.540
I got to see Rurumo again because 
you delivered those tickets.

00:21:01.540 --> 00:21:02.360
Thanks.

00:21:02.830 --> 00:21:04.610
Ya don't gotta thank me.

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:07.870
The cat spoke!

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:09.900
I forgot to tell ya somethin'.

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:11.580
And in a Kansai accent!

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:14.920
Listen, ya can't tell Rurumo,

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:19.340
but the rules say I gotta tell 
whoever's got the tickets.

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:23.460
These tickets come in stacks of 666.

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:26.870
Ya already used a few today.

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:27.470
But these...

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:29.720
are your life.

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:33.930
When they run out, you die.

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:37.760
Rurumo's got an unusual 
personality for a witch.

00:21:37.760 --> 00:21:40.700
She wouldn't let ya use 
any magic if she knew this.

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:42.290
It's our secret!

00:21:44.840 --> 00:21:48.310
What, you're sleepin'? Oh, come on...

00:23:21.120 --> 00:23:22.720
You're not very dependable, are ya?

00:23:22.720 --> 00:23:24.250
Should I find another contractor?

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:26.940
No. Anyway, where are we going to live now?

00:23:26.940 --> 00:23:30.590
A big, sunny place.

00:23:30.590 --> 00:23:35.750
<b>Next Episode: Dream Cohabitation</b>

00:23:31.170 --> 00:23:33.640
The next episode is "Dream Cohabitation."

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:35.750
I look forward to it.
